WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
01 · OVERVIEW: Participate ethically and thoughtfully online. Respecting consent, laws, and peers shapes healthier digital spaces for everyone.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
02 · FOOTPRINT: Posts, likes, and uploads leave a lasting trail. Even deleted stories can survive in cached archives or peer screenshots.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
03 · CONSENT: Protect privacy before sharing photos or details. Never post another person's home address, grades, ID, or private chat without asking.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
04 · FAIR CREDIT: Honor copyright, licenses & academic integrity. Filter creative works by Creative Commons (CC BY) and cite the original creator.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
05 · REPORT ABUSE: Document, block & report instead of piling on. Support affected peers and escalate serious harassment through proper channels.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
06 · TRY IT: Audit your social privacy settings & license checks. Practice writing one full Creative Commons attribution credit line today.
